@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: ScheduleConsultation
!theme plain
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
actor "Scheduler" as Actor
participant "InsuranceService" as InsuranceService
participant "SchedulingService" as SchedulingService

note over Actor : Register visit reason
Actor -> InsuranceService : Validate coverage(policyNumber, visitType)
InsuranceService -> SchedulingService : Reserve physician(specialty, preferredDate)
SchedulingService -> Actor : Confirm appointment(appointmentCode)
@enduml
